## Phases

*Fill in the line when closing the phase gate. Phase closed before measurement begins:
`| Fn | not measured — before instantiation | — | — | — | — | — | |` (the gate does not count
it). "AI cost": tokens or €, whatever the tool gives — consistent within the project. Source: sum of the "AI cost" fields in `STATE.md` §Done
since the previous phase closed (plus the milestone totals archived in §Historical log).
"Rework": slices/artifacts redone because of a defect or a divergence from the spec — counted
from artifacts marked `obsolete` and from reopened slices recorded in `STATE.md` §Done.
"Questions to the user": count of the `## P-nnn` entries raised in the phase in
`product/01-requirements/questions-and-answers.md`. "1st?": the "attempt #" of the gate record in
`product/99-records/gates/` (1 with "passed" = yes). The example line below is deleted on
instantiation; each phase close adds its own.*

