## Evolutions (F9)

*In F9 it never closes a phase again; it closes an evolution — each `EV-nnn` from
`workflows/W10-feature-evolution.md` is a miniature F2→F8 and gains its line here at the exit
gate. It is the mature product's curve: each evolution cheaper and better than the previous one.
"Days": from the request being recorded (`product/99-records/evolutions/EV-nnn.md`) to
production. The remaining columns are measured as in the phases, from the evolution's
`STATE.md` §Done blocks.*

| Evolution | Closed on | Days (request → production) | AI cost | Questions to the user | Rework | 1st? | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| EV-{{nnn}} | {{yyyy-mm-dd}} | {{n}} | {{…}} | {{n}} | {{…}} | {{yes/no}} | {{…}} |

