where it was worse, and the hypothesis of why — this is what curation wants to read}}.

*In a product adopted while already in production there is no F0 → production to measure: the
Close reads "not applicable — adopted in F9" and curation reads the trend in §Evolutions
instead.*

> **Sending:** the Close block goes in the improvement report at the F8 close
> (`playbooks/report-framework-improvements.md`); curation updates the upstream curve with
> the project's code (P2, P3, …) — never the name (`knowledge/candidates.md` §Entry and exit rules,
> rule 5).

